  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Broken Branch also taught me things, gave names to feelings my mind couldn't create before. I look back at my unlife and I feel... remorse?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_035.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I am uncertain. My thoughts are abuzz with contradictory notions. The only one cutting through the noise is retaliation.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_036.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I was discarded like refuse by my own House, by my Sire, by Count Strigoi himself.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_037.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Thus the Broken Branch brought me here to tell my tale and expose his lies! You wish to find them? Why? Revenge? I won't allow it.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_038.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They may have reduced me to this form, but, I am not sure, it may have been a rescue, no? And in seeking my revenge, not yours, we may rescue others.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_039.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "These humans - cowed and docile - have no idea what purpose they serve. Perhaps you should see for yourself.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_040.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Talk to them of their lives and their ambitions. See the pattern they are raised to ignore. Then tell me the Broken Branch are the villains here.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Player_LucyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Lucy_Easton_DM-MORT_041.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687154,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Outsiders? Why're you askin' about Outsiders? You're the only outsider 'ere, stranger. This is our village, always has been.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Mira_Tanner_DM-MORT_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We work the farms, tend the crop, and live our lives. Well, all 'cept the lucky few who Ascend.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Mira_Tanner_DM-MORT_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh, yea, blessed blighters get chosen by Count Strigoi hisself to ascend to the castle, drink the sacred draught and join the House of Cups.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Mira_Tanner_DM-MORT_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh, what I wouldn't give.... Still, ain't up to me. Tis the Mayor and Sir Dracus who decide these things. But one day, surely, they will notice me.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Mira_Tanner_DM-MORT_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Did you calm that dissenter? To think, raving like she was that the House of Cups lie. How could they, when they are us?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Mayor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Mayor_McCreary_DM-MORT_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687151,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Why, just a week past, I personally escorted a group of twenty to the Chapel of Ascension - the largest crop yet!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Mayor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Mayor_McCreary_DM-MORT_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687151,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They sit at Strigoi's side now. Else, where would they be? Now, please excuse me, a mayor's work is never done.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Mayor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Mayor_McCreary_DM-MORT_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687151,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Psst! Hey, over here.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Bruno_DM-MORT_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687161,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You seem to possess an inquisitive mind, a rare quality amongst this herd of dullards. But how far are you willing to go?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Bruno_DM-MORT_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687161,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Broken Branch? All roads lead to them. Everything explains them, at least in part.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Bruno_DM-MORT_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687161,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "To understand your foe, you must understand their threat. And Count Strigoi, the Lord of Cups, threatens all. So how do we find out how?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Bruno_DM-MORT_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687161,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Well, there's storming his castle, no mean feat. Or perhaps simply go there...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Bruno_DM-MORT_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687161,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The House of Sanguine Mercy, a hospital of sorts, but with unconventional methods of treatment. Treat yourself, why don't you, to their mercies?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Bruno_DM-MORT_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687161,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So, here to take me back to the Arcanum in chains?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-MORT_033.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
